	<string id="ui_mcm_dogma_hud_stalker_id_page_description">
		<text>Centered name, rank, and faction icon when looking near stalkers. Soft aim picks the closest neck/torso projection to screen center within the aim radius. Optional LOS recast walks nearer candidates until one is visible. Leader line from the ID UI to the target (always, hold key, or while binoculars are raised). Losing target fades out over 2 seconds. Disable Identification UI (CrookR) and Crook's Identification UI Fix.</text>
	</string>

